Simulation_G4/inverse.py contains a modified adaptation of NeuroDyn-EEG.
Upstream: https://github.com/Gnosis-Neurodynamics/NeuroDyn-EEG
Commit: c9dd9074818e80bfe8e8ba7b2787cf5d8a2be38c
Original file: TrainWorks/src/model.py; license Apache-2.0.
Original source did not include a separate NOTICE file or copyright header.
Modifications: physical-unit names, joint bounds, relative regularization,
compact profile, explicit training splits, normalized loss and prediction helpers.
No upstream pretrained weights or omitted forward-model resources are included.

Also bundled: reference/aal_regions.csv, copied unchanged from upstream
validation/config/aal_regions.csv at the same commit and under the accompanying
Apache-2.0 project license. It is an atlas index lookup, not an EEG recording.
